Profile pictures of steering committee members current and past go in this index. 
The images are sorted into the directory of the **first letter of the Last Name** of the person, while the file is named with the full First and Last name(s) of the person, with any spaces coverted to underscores.
Avoid using special accent characters, as that makes it harder to maintain the website long-term. (i.e. `í` -> `i` in file names).
Take care to distinguish between people with two first names, vs two last names!

e.g.
 - Thiseas Christos Lamnidis -> L/Thiseas_Christos_Lamnidis.jpg (two first names)
 - Epifanía Arango Isaza     -> A/Epifania_Arango_Isaza.jpg     (two last names, and special characters)
 - Anna-Lena Titze           -> T/Anna-Lena_Titze.jpg           (hyphenated first name kept hyphenated)
